# Settlement Spec

Settlement defines what each participant earns after verified work.

```json
{
  "settlement_id": "settle_001",
  "task_id": "task_001",
  "status": "settled",
  "participants": [
    {
      "entity_id": "skill_001",
      "role": "skill_provider",
      "unit": "AIC",
      "amount": 5,
      "reason": "Provided verified code review capability"
    }
  ]
}
```
